    "description": "Torrent Pharmaceuticals Consulting Pvt Ltd has an exciting opening for a Consultant Physician at our Indore office. Join a company that values innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout Torrent Pharmaceuticals Consulting Pvt Ltd:\nTorrent Pharmaceuticals Consulting Pvt Ltd is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Maintain accurate clinical documentation in electronic health records\n• Participate in quality improvement initiatives and clinical audits\n• Ensure patient privacy and maintain confidentiality\n• Provide high-quality patient care and maintain patient records\n• Educate patients and families on health management and disease prevention\n• Conduct routine health assessments and screenings\n• Maintain sterile environments and follow infection control protocols\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Bachelor's degree in a relevant field\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Clinical Research\n• Proficiency in ICD-10\n• Proficiency in Telemedicine\n• Proficiency in Medical Coding\n• Proficiency in Health Informatics\n• Proficiency in NABH Standards\n• Proficiency in Wound Care\n• Proficiency in Infection Control\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Referral bonus program\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Indore, Madhya Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Torrent Pharmaceuticals Consulting Pvt Ltd!",
